{"t":"Poison Field","s":"poison-field-deeac","k":"spell","i":"assets/wiki/Poison_Field_37d49d.gif","q":13,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p><i>This article is about the <b>Poison Field</b> rune. For Poison clouds, see <a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Gas\">Poison Gas</a></i>.</p><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Poison Field</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Poison Field\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"38\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poison_Field_37d49d.gif\" width=\"38\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Usage Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"words\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Words</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\">adevo grav pox</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"damagetype\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Magic Type</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Earth Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_7605e0.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span> Earth Damage</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"mana\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Mana</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">200</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"subclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Group</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Support Spells\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Support_Cooldown_5c2691.png\" width=\"20\"/></span></span> Support (2 sec CD)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"cooldown\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Individual Cooldown</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2 seconds</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirement Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"voc\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Vocation</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Druid\">Druid</a><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Sorcerer\">Sorcerer</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"promotion\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Promotion</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"soul\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Soul Points</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"levelrequired\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">14</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"runegroup\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Rune Group</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Attack Runes</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unknown.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Spells <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-effect\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Effect\">Effect</span></h3>\n<p>Makes 3 Poison Field Runes (requiring 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Blank%20Rune\">Blank Rune</a>).\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<div class=\"webdesc\">\n<blockquote class=\"webdesc-text\"><p>After careful study of the existing varieties, the druids came up with this contribution to the field spell arsenal. Making use of their pre-eminent knowledge of all kinds of toxins they devised a way to create small pockets of poison gas which remain stable for several minutes before dissipating. Anybody who enters these fields will be affected by a vicious toxin. Consequently, many creatures will avoid them, although strong monsters or creatures that are immune to poison will not hesitate to move into them. Still, the spell is usually well suited to create protective barriers. Also, its usefulness as a cheap attack spell to be cast on weaker creatures must not be underestimated.\nPlease note that on optional PvP game worlds this spell has no damaging effect on other characters, unless characters are war opponents.</p></blockquote>\n<div class=\"webdesc-from\" style=\"float: right; margin: 0 2em 0 0;\">—Tibia Library</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-spell-animation\"></div>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Spells\">Related Spells</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Support_Spells\">Support Spells</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li>Animate Dead</li><li>Arrow Call</li><li>Aura of Exposed Weakness</li><li>Aura of Sapped Strength</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Avalanche\">Avalanche</a></li><li>Avatar of Balance</li><li>Avatar of Light</li><li>Avatar of Nature</li><li>Avatar of Steel</li><li>Avatar of Storm</li><li>Balanced Brawl</li><li>Blood Rage</li><li>Cancel Invisibility</li><li>Cancel Magic Shield</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Challenge\">Challenge</a></li><li>Chameleon</li><li>Charge</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Chivalrous%20Challenge\">Chivalrous Challenge</a></li><li>Conjure Arrow</li><li>Conjure Explosive Arrow</li><li>Conjure Wand of Darkness</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Convince%20Creature\">Convince Creature</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Creature%20Illusion\">Creature Illusion</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cure%20Poison%20Rune\">Cure Poison Rune</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Destroy%20Field\">Destroy Field</a></li><li>Disintegrate</li><li>Divine Dazzle</li><li>Divine Defiance</li><li>Divine Empowerment</li><li>Elemental Synthesis</li><li>Enchant Party</li><li>Enchant Spear</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Bomb\">Energy Bomb</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Field\">Energy Field</a></li><li>Energy Wall</li><li>Enlighten Party</li><li>Explosion</li><li>Find Fiend</li><li>Find Person</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Bomb\">Fire Bomb</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Field\">Fir